      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR ROCKY (9) has been hard to fault since switching from NSW, recording four wins and a nose second in five outings at this circuit. Had enough speed to lead from a wide draw then dug deep last time. Up in distance and starts on the back row for the first time since heading north but he is going well enough to overcome it. IM BOO NZ (3) led from a similar barrier to win here last month and gave a good sight again when runner-up last week. Should be prominent. ALWAYS ADORNED (8) continues to perform well having added to a long string of top-four results when second last week. Proven at this longer distance so could threaten. APOLLO DREAMZ (4) only missed narrowly here last time and returns to the front line.",
